<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="MA cycles" id="ma"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1500" pageHeight="1400" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c11" value="Terminology and convention" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="680" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b style='font-size:18px'&gt;Terminology and abbreviations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;MA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Maintenance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Quadrimester (quad)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1/3 of a year, a 4-month period. Quad 1 = Jan–Apr, Quad 2 = May–Aug, Quad 3 = Sep–Dec.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Birth block&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The quad a store was installed in: &lt;i&gt;Installation date - Year&lt;/i&gt; + &lt;i&gt;Installation date - Quad&lt;/i&gt; on Job locations (formulas). E.g. installed 05-Jul-2024 → 2024 · Quad 2.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cycle (MAC-YYYY - N)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A quad with a year on it, e.g. MAC-2026 - 1 = Jan–Apr 2026. The block a PM visit is &lt;b&gt;due&lt;/b&gt; in. A label only; nothing enforces it. Records hold no dates.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Quad ≠ cycle&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Quad (on a package) = when the stores were installed. Cycle (on a PM item) = when the visit is due.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Package (MPA-xxxx)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Maintenance contract for one franchisee × one birth block × one version. Created by hand.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Version (V1, V2, …)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Contract generation for that group. V1 = first contract, V2 = renewal (follow-on). No link field between them; matched by same Customer + Year + Quad.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Item (MPI-xxxx)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;One visit on a package's menu, a template. Every store in the package gets one job per item.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ma - Preventive. Planned check-up. The only item type with a cycle.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;RM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ma - Reactive. Call-out slot, used only if something breaks (≈2% ever used).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job (JOB-xxxxxxxx)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;One visit at one store. Lives in the Jobs table.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ma - Jobs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PM checklist record (ticks, comments, photos, delivery note). 1:1 with a PM job.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Add new&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job locations field &lt;i&gt;Ma - Package - Add new&lt;/i&gt;. Putting a package here creates that store's jobs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CRG / QSA / RD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The three KFC franchisees in Thailand (THA).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Templates&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;2024 CRG/RD contracts: 3 PM + 0 RM. Everything from 2025 and all V2: 1 PM + 2 RM.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=13;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="120" width="680" height="1120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="How MA cycles work (example: MPA-0032)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#FFFFFF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="40" width="620" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;span style='background:#FFF2CC;border:1px solid #D6B656;padding:2px 6px'&gt;By hand&lt;/span&gt; typed by a person, nothing checks it &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='background:#D5E8D4;border:1px solid #82B366;padding:2px 6px'&gt;Automatic&lt;/span&gt; formula or automation &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='background:#DAE8FC;border:1px solid #6C8EBF;padding:2px 6px'&gt;Mixed&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="110" width="620" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Calendar blocks&lt;/b&gt; — by hand&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Table:&lt;/b&gt; Ma - Cycles&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fields:&lt;/b&gt; Year, Cycle (1–3). No dates stored.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Example:&lt;/b&gt; MAC-2026 - 1 = Jan–Apr 2026. Created in batches a year ahead (last batch 19-Nov-2024). Nothing exists after 2026-3." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="160" width="620" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="&lt;b&gt;2. Store birth block&lt;/b&gt; — automatic&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Table:&lt;/b&gt; Job locations&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fields:&lt;/b&gt; Installation date - First (rollup) → Installation date - Year, Installation date - Quad (formulas)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Example:&lt;/b&gt; Lotus Kalasin, installed 05-Jul-2024 → 2024 · Quad 2" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="310" width="620" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c15" target="c16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Package = contract for one group&lt;/b&gt; — by hand&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Table:&lt;/b&gt; Ma - Packages&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fields:&lt;/b&gt; Customer, Installation date - Year, Installation date - Quad, Version, Valid from, Valid to, Job locations&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Example:&lt;/b&gt; MPA-0032 = CRG · 2024 · Quad 3 · V2, valid 01-Jan-2025 → 30-Nov-2026, 93 stores. Renews MPA-0008 (CRG · 2024 · Quad 3 · V1)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="450" width="620" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c16" target="c18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="&lt;b&gt;4. Items = the visit menu&lt;/b&gt; — by hand&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Table:&lt;/b&gt; Ma - Items&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fields:&lt;/b&gt; Ma - Package, Job type (PM / RM), Valid from, Valid to&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Example:&lt;/b&gt; MPI-0099 PM, 01-Jan-2026 → 31-May-2026&lt;br&gt;MPI-0100 + MPI-0101 RM, 01-Nov-2025 → 30-Nov-2026" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="610" width="620" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c18" target="c20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Cycle linked to each PM item&lt;/b&gt; — by hand&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Field:&lt;/b&gt; Ma - Items.Cycle → Ma - Cycles (RM items never get one)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Habit V1:&lt;/b&gt; the block after the stores' birth block (Quad 1→2, Quad 2→3, Quad 3→1 next year). 3-PM packages take 3 blocks in a row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Habit V2:&lt;/b&gt; the block the renewal is created in; one later if V1 already has a PM there.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Example:&lt;/b&gt; MPI-0099 → MAC-2026 - 1 (created Nov 2025; MPA-0008 already had 2025-3)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="760" width="620" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c20" target="c22"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b&gt;6. Add new → one job per item per store&lt;/b&gt; — automatic&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trigger:&lt;/b&gt; put the package in Job locations.Ma - Package - Add new&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Automation:&lt;/b&gt; Create MA jobs - Jobs → files package into Ma - Package, clears Add new, creates jobs&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Job fields set:&lt;/b&gt; Ma - Item, Job type, Location, Ma - Package, Status = Unscheduled. No date. Ma - Cycle = lookup via item.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Example:&lt;/b&gt; 93 stores × 3 items = 279 jobs on MPA-0032" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="930" width="620" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c22" target="c24"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;7. Book, visit, close&lt;/b&gt; — by hand + automatic&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Book (hand):&lt;/b&gt; set Jobs.Date - Scheduled, Status → Tentative / Scheduled&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Checklist (auto):&lt;/b&gt; Create MA jobs - Ma Jobs → creates Ma - Jobs record (PM only, 1:1)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notify (button):&lt;/b&gt; Send mail - Ma schedule → ticks Ma - Schedule sent&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visit (hand):&lt;/b&gt; tech fills Tick - Connectivity / Mounts / Screens + photos in Ma - Jobs&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Close (auto):&lt;/b&gt; upload Image - Delivery note → FS - Ma - PM - Close job → PDF GP/TEM-008 → Done&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Example:&lt;/b&gt; JOB-00005236, Tiwanon Talad Kwan, MAC-2026 - 1, done 29-May-2026. Only 40% of visits land inside their cycle block; 59% in the next." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#DAE8FC;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="1110" width="620" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c24" target="c26"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c28" value="&lt;b&gt;8. Contract tracking&lt;/b&gt; — automatic&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fields:&lt;/b&gt; Status, Days left (package, item) · Jobs - PM - Done - Count (package) · Check - Ma - Valid date (job)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Example:&lt;/b&gt; MPA-0032 Active, ends 30-Nov-2026.&lt;br&gt;No alert on expiry or on unbooked visits." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="1330" width="620" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c29" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#666666;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c26" target="c28"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>